    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1kf6t38",
      "content": "The Char Dham (Four Shrines) is one of the most important Hindu pilgrimages in India. The four shrines are located in the Garhwal Himalayas and are open only from May to November (closed in winter due to heavy snowfall)."
    },
